      <div class="space-y-4 my-8">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">
            Can you actually get a good treadmill for under $1,000?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed m-0">
            Yes, with realistic expectations. Under $1,000 you can get a
            reliable folding or full-size treadmill with a 2.0-3.0 CHP motor,
